WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:01.790
- Oh, sorry sweetie, this chocolate bar

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.253
is actually really spicy.

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:04.472
You wouldn't like it.

00:00:04.472 --> 00:00:07.816
("Gypsy Sailor")

00:00:07.816 --> 00:00:10.358
- So big news, Santa called,

00:00:10.358 --> 00:00:11.856
he wants you to take a nap.

00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:14.259
- All right, you can stay
out here playing if you want,

00:00:14.259 --> 00:00:15.676
just look out for that bear.

00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:18.519
- I don't know what happened
to that very loud drum toy.

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:19.936
It must have gotten stolen.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:22.397
- Sorry honey, the TV only
works when it's raining.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.511
- Ah honey, Disneyland is closed today.

00:00:24.511 --> 00:00:25.660
Mickey's sick.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.634
- Actually, if the ice cream
truck is playing music,

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:28.992
that means they're out of ice cream.

00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:31.732
- Sorry sweetheart, the soda
actually has coffee in it.

00:00:31.732 --> 00:00:32.777
You wouldn't like it.

00:00:32.777 --> 00:00:34.657
- No honey, that animal
at the side of the road

00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:35.900
was just taking a nap.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.012
- OK fine, I'm leaving without you.

00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:41.695
- Oh, it's six o'clock,
internet lady is turning off

00:00:41.695 --> 00:00:43.495
the world's internet for the night.

00:00:43.495 --> 00:00:46.114
- I am serious mister, I am
starting the car right now.

00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:47.123
- You know what happens
if you don't behave

00:00:47.123 --> 00:00:48.505
in the drive-thru line?

00:00:48.505 --> 00:00:49.701
They give you a sad meal.

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:52.905
- And we're gone, God
(bleep) Jackson, right now.

00:00:52.905 --> 00:00:57.905
("Gypsy Sailor")

